<title>AUSTRALIA: Biggest gains/falls for ASX 100 index in past week.</title>
<headline>Biggest gains/falls for ASX 100 index in past week.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following is a list of the 10 largest gaining and falling stocks for Australian companies included in the Australian Stock Exchange's ASX 100 index for the week to July 11.</p>
<p>Top 10 largest gains in week	  Percent</p>
<p>Rank Name			Price     change</p>
<p> 1  Normandy Min		1.54	9.22</p>
<p> 2  Fosters Brew Grp	  2.64	7.76</p>
<p> 3  Santos			6.00	5.26</p>
<p> 4  Village Road-Pr	   3.65	4.29</p>
<p> 5  Macquarie Bank	   12.85	3.63</p>
<p> 6  David Jones		 2.01	3.61</p>
<p> 7  Westfield Amer T	  1.20	3.45</p>
<p> 8  Syd Hrbr Casino	   2.12	2.91</p>
<p> 9  A N Z Bank		 10.15	2.84</p>
<p>10  Natl Aust Bank	   19.95	2.84</p>
<p>Top 10 largest falls in week	   Percent</p>
<p>Rank Name			Price     change</p>
<p> 1  Newcrest Mining	   2.50    -21.87</p>
<p> 2  Centaur Min&amp;Expl	  1.25    -20.89</p>
<p> 3  Acacia Resources	  1.39    -13.66</p>
<p> 4  PMP Comms		   3.20    -13.51</p>
<p> 5  Coca-Cola Am	     15.00    -11.76</p>
<p> 6  Goodman Fielder	   1.78     -7.29</p>
<p> 7  Plutonic Rsc		3.81     -7.19</p>
<p> 8  Comalco		     6.63     -7.17</p>
<p> 9  Fletcher NZ Fst	   1.83     -6.63</p>
<p>10  Lihir Gold		  1.90     -6.40</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
